      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%a_h_rank1，占据了领先位置",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ddb80c63143920fb1b4f4dd1577bfbdd050bc58c9616c634611f2e83ebb888a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "646"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a21beceeacfd921f5487db",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "以精彩表现收官的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n是与最终比赛相称的极佳跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64498bde8322fd2d1b159b3569fe1d72b1433840a10f5fbc3d85f1fb242a425f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896bfe2366901571fddff781",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第1名是%h_rank_l1！\\n以压倒性的跑法\\n证明了自己是英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd068611e1a8eed078b138a30d07c955341053de294355f42f0171ecf020b979",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73803080799a7da2e5bc00d1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第1名冲线的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n这般强大正是英雄的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cf81de12a84c0bee52ad36e326ff7c927cff82234f9d0c7299a3b320999e0e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebba138363736259f5c46734",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！\\n众多马娘中，\\n她绝不将主人公的位置让给任何人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "878676916b1cfa6b61dac3f92d7d08f57b85687d8f233efe518e8ff58a0c13e1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb269b9ed80b0856ee3fa88b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这场比赛的主角是，%h_rank_l1！\\n荣耀的光辉照耀着这位赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17c278360a4d3ece8a15faea0dbc14fbdc94099b7ec4b802cb12b1c8f99dafc6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6464"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f68b3c8e97ed9ce36eec1ae3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这场英雄云集的比赛中夺得胜利的是\\n%h_rank_l1！\\n粉丝们也以盛大的欢呼声祝福她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c005d7a190378437f2d406117bf9545a4d18af36bf4d66833b6d27a23e7db574",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556d2284bcaa58d72ea4a529",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "第1名是%h_rank_l1！\\n众多观众的注目下，\\n她展现出了最棒的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7da0d9abe78f07b08c8b650c8da4d05f093ff64e12b9890be991cd1864838be",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6466"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89f287378f8bed5971cb6b7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是%h_rank_ta1！\\n这是一场值得流传千古的\\n传说般的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85582d07ec8d5e8638843158465e1379d51661a64b260d7a736be2cdb90c189f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6467"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c28a98d00bb78fcfb2e8ab5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这场世纪之战中获胜的是\\n%h_rank_l1！\\n她会是一种怎样的跑法和生活方式！\\n真是一位超级英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd1848c5a76d5b723ea59c98c665b35eb3fb37f21c32ba3ec41fce360393c976",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6468"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec249cf45e27a5cdf5deb96",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "这一战将决出顶点！\\n群英月赛 MILE决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7339c1b34d6d4c3a2415c76cab2d9a31492be5b00da152cef9006e66963335",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6469"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858d7f0c2e52a03684e13e32",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "现在处于领先的是%h_rank_ta1",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a4694a8d14b9ef1e76d768bfc280ffb6396991342ce4e8ca1ccc9726c5bc568",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "647"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722736fc25fc6ad799cd48e1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "大舞台终于拉开了帷幕！\\n群英月赛 MILE决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f1307097f957568958052dedef260e58196e9c21ea809259b95dd2996dd405c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6470"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cb774d90c94f0e9cadf4c0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "她做到了%h_rank_l1！\\n精彩的首位冲线，\\n群英月赛 MILE制胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a49645ab801e4ffe70f4d33fbbe0578c64ba7aa1c2f0035f7f9c4790229a53",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86da4d4867c24ba9f7ec7870",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "优胜者是%h_rank_l1！\\n以出色的表现，\\n在英里界的顶点闪耀着光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cc9cd95a128319974cce2f7907b63845be4f23ebad87303cc37f42bd01e3bde",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceb1171a119df592982d7866",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "现在开始，L'Arc代表交流战第1战！\\n来自海外的竞争对手们云集于此，等待开赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "52719ab2af5ad001b90ef0332b97c517630a82a65dcf387870d2b714253afff3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb5773eb22beaedffbdf22e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "L'Arc代表交流战第2次举办\\n能够在隆尚这个艰苦马场环境下获胜的\\n证明自己实力的赛马娘会是谁呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe46ade91f47bb2c44d316bb5f31ee8350d7522b0eca41f5857275571e9d32eb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa1490ecc3e80ed0d01d7ba",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "邀请海外强豪们参与的代表交流战第3战\\n日本选手们会向我们\\n展现一场怎样的比赛呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "924b4c08c56486a9287894a65406df804327d40ebfe283116025bff680d806e2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6475"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0120fd3786edd008cbffe38c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "会涌现出今年的凯旋门赏赛马娘吗！\\n现在开始，L'Arc代表交流战第4战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cd60ddf088a7edbda8318ca6ebb63246d6eac0cadf7c46682818a88dc73900f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaa120f699c77d297786ad08",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "凯旋门赏的前哨战，尼尔赏！\\n年轻的挑战者们\\n向着最高峰的舞台，展开激烈竞争",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc90fd10aa07180b1104afa8b518e38950402440642b879dcd6657efacb52c8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7933252b6fb5cfe932ae7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们胸怀全日本粉丝的夙愿起跑，\\n凯旋门赏！\\n能够获得荣光的会是哪一位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "053a83f047c4d37728ca9c57a0ac416334225d1503fd6d3dd554db825f97ac2e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6478"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c589a98e98fdde69aa09b8f8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "预测今年凯旋门赏成败的试金石，富瓦赏！\\n向着最高峰的舞台，\\n蓄势待发的会是哪一位赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d23fdd49494dea0256378d65d65b39b0b98161f1a82c91ad0a1368e2531cc5d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1551911e6828c8de91f578ad",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%a_h_rank1\\n夺得领先",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1eb1f03382531a65b9b32cd717643a37fe5b9f8a814f04958ba6a75e2d018e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "648"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e6b8c17545281a688b3daf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "事关能否成就伟业获得连霸的一战\\n荣光之顶峰，凯旋门赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d20806671bf06247046721ff73b070139d07ffefd65149890ae438ed3435a48a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6480"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e3a25a5187153a616df293",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够既前哨战之后继续制霸凯旋门赏吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "012161a3401375412157fc1a3eb5d4623c5e48721bafcab636c829bf5cc0f71d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:807670cdeaaae3281a04951b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "能够达成制霸凯旋门赏的\\n伟业吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "472eac35578953e6bb6372747d5a7c205abd51faedceb695ebb0f22eb9b62e21",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889a0795e75ccd80ef63721a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "接下来要跑上隆尚竞马场困难的陡坡",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60fc7b82684e97a5e59ebcf561ad064faddd3143065c165b08c54b9b8dceb5c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6483"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eac70c7cfbd8b48955b52d4a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘现在冲出丛林\\n向上陡坡跑去",
      "source_fingerprint": "675c30b55dc5028fce5a4526c6548ebbe3bd43145ba8ea86517f156a92ca9c45",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "6484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae71603a096d5aeb970a2f0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
